      ":question/problem": "Given that\n\n$$\nT=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -9 & 1 \\\\ -8 & 2 & -7 \\\\ 6 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nwhich of the following elementary row operations makes $a_{11}=0$?",
